390
00:19:46,204 --> 00:19:47,504
はいはいはい
Okay, okay, okay.

391
00:19:48,404 --> 00:19:49,804
はいはいはい
Right, right, right.

392
00:19:50,704 --> 00:19:51,704
零山
Reizen.

393
00:19:52,404 --> 00:19:53,504
零山
Reizen.

